  "ordinal": 0,
  "summary": "Crude Oil Trade Flows Keep Changing Year Over Year\nAs we are approaching the end of the first quarter of 2016, we have taken a closer look at our dirty fixture information for 2015 as it compares to 2014 and Q1 2016. The objective is to identify dirty trade routes that have seen significant changes from one year to the next. We use the spot fixture information for 2016 year-to-date to see if these changes could be the beginning of a trend or if they were a one-off aberration, not to be repeated.",
